            </note>
            <note corresp="#d167-f4" n="4" xml:id="d167-f4-content">
                <p>The Morgan Line is shown on the map
                    attached to the Belgrade agreement of June 9, 1945 (Executive Agreement Series
                    No. 501). This map is also reproduced in <hi rendition="#italic">United States
                        Statutes at Large</hi>, vol. 59, pt. 2 (inside back cover). A map showing
                    the Morgan Line in less detail is
                    printed in Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">xvi</hi>, p. 1264.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
